{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-200783-r4595349","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Beef Yakiniku Pizza","sourcePageId":200783,"sourceRevision":"4595349","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-10-31T18:58:45Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Beef%20Yakiniku%20Pizza&oldid=4595349","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T12:24:42.134Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Expensive recipes","Category:Japanese recipes","Category:Medium Difficulty recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes for pizza","Category:Recipes for pizza dough","Category:Recipes using beef loin","Category:Recipes using cornstarch","Category:Recipes using granulated sugar","Category:Recipes using mirin","Category:Recipes using pizza dough","Category:Recipes using vegetable oil","Category:Recipes using wheat flour","Category:Recipes with metric units"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"2f14d72cf844660afca62ae94eb494b802dd980f6cc842eba1a776caa2a32e99","sourceWikitext":"__NOTOC__\n{{Recipesummary|category=Pizza recipes|servings=12|time=1 hour 30 minutes|difficulty=3\n| Energy = 4.8 Mcal\n}}\n\n{{Recipe}} | [[Cookbook:Cuisine of Japan|Cuisine of Japan]]\n\nYakiniku is a Japanese term referring broadly to grilled or barbecued meat dishes. This recipe tops pizza dough with a yakiniku-style beef stir-fry. \n\n==Ingredients==\n\n===Dough===\n\n* 600 [[Cookbook:Gram|g]] high-protein [[Cookbook:Flour|flour]]\n* 200 g low-protein [[Cookbook:Flour|flour]]\n* 15 g instant [[Cookbook:Yeast|yeast]]\n* 3 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tbsp]] [[Cookbook:Sugar|sugar]]\n* 75 [[Cookbook:Milliliter|ml]] [[Cookbook:Water|cold water]]\n* ¾ [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|tsp]] [[Cookbook:Salt|salt]]\n\n===Topping===\n* 2 tbsp [[Cookbook:Oil|vegetable oil]]\n* ½ big [[Cookbook:Onion|onion]], [[Cookbook:Chopping|chopped]]\n* ½ red [[Cookbook:Capsicum|capsicum]], cut into 10 pieces\n* 600 g tenderloin [[Cookbook:Beef|beef]], cut into 2 x 1 x 1 [[Cookbook:Centimetre (cm)|cm]] pieces\n* 100 ml [[Cookbook:Water|water]]\n* 2 tbsp [[Cookbook:Mirin|mirin]]\n* 2 tbsp light [[Cookbook:Soy sauce|soy sauce]]\n* 2 tbsp [[Cookbook:Oyster sauce|oyster sauce]]\n* 2 tbsp [[Cookbook:Cornstarch|cornstarch]], dissolved with 20 ml [[Cookbook:Water|water]]\n* 1 tbsp [[Cookbook:Salt|salt]]\n* 1 tbsp [[Cookbook:Sugar|sugar]]\n\n===Spreading===\n\n* 5 tbsp [[Cookbook:Tomato Sauce|tomato sauce]]\n\n==Procedure==\n\n=== Dough ===\n#Combine flours, yeast, sugar, water, and salt to make a dough. \n#Cover with [[Cookbook:Plastic wrap|plastic wrap]], and rest the dough 10 minutes until expanded.\n\n=== Topping ===\n# Heat the oil in a non-stick pan. Add the onion and capsicum, and sauté for 10 seconds.\n#Add the tenderloin and the water. Add the mirin, soy sauce, and oyster sauce.\n# Add the dissolved cornflour, salt, and sugar. Stir until well-mixed and slightly thickened.\n#Separate the solids from the extra sauce. Reserve the sauce to serve with the pizza. \n\n=== Finishing ===\n# Roll out the pizza dough to a 10 cm diameter. Spread the meat topping on top.\n# [[Cookbook:Baking|Bake]] pizza in the [[Cookbook:Oven|oven]] at 220°C for 20 minutes.\n# Serve hot with the dipping sauces.\n\n[[Category:Expensive recipes]]\n[[Category:Japanese recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using beef loin]]\n[[Category:Recipes with metric units]]\n[[Category:Recipes for pizza]]\n[[Category:Recipes using granulated sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cornstarch]]\n[[Category:Recipes using pizza dough]]\n[[Category:Recipes using wheat flour]]\n[[Category:Recipes using vegetable oil]]\n[[Category:Recipes for pizza dough]]\n[[Category:Recipes using mirin]]","isRecipe":false,"recipe":{"name":"Beef Yakiniku Pizza","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[],"steps":[],"nutrition":null,"gaps":["Research extraction only; no culinary/editorial review.","Ingredient quantities, units, alternatives, food identities, aggregate duration, and nutrition remain unknown until individually parsed/reviewed.","Source-level CC BY-SA policy applies generally; page-specific exceptions have not been checked."]}},"parsedRecipe":{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"wikibooks:200783","recordId":"wikibooks-200783-r4595349","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceRevision":"4595349","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Beef%20Yakiniku%20Pizza&oldid=4595349","sourceSha256":"2f14d72cf844660afca62ae94eb494b802dd980f6cc842eba1a776caa2a32e99","parserVersion":"wikibooks-sections-v3","quantityParserVersion":"source-prefix-v2","license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"reviewStatus":"source-extracted-unrevi